{"seq":3,"slug":"quota-balance-allocation-order","title":"配额余额查询、申请与下单占用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/quota-balance-allocation-order","wordCount":1780,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"配额余额查询-申请与下单占用\">配额余额查询、申请与下单占用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>配额余额是一个<strong>会自己变化的外部状态</strong>：它被其他进口商共同消耗、被主管机关在期中重新分配、被过期证件归还、被新一期的开放重置。任何&quot;缓存一份余额、用一年&quot;的实现都会在几周内失准。这一章处理的是：余额从哪里来、以什么频率同步、在多长的决策窗口内可信，以及如何把余额信号接到&quot;申请—下单—报关&quot;的动作链上。</p>\n<p>余额的两个外部可观测属性是&quot;<strong>是否耗尽</strong>&quot;与&quot;<strong>是否关键</strong>&quot;。欧盟 TARIC 配额查询同时暴露这两者：状态字段取值包含 Exhausted / Not exhausted / Blocked / Not blocked，另有独立的 Critical（关键）筛选维度，官方每日更新（页面上标注&quot;Last tariff QUOTA update: 25-09-2026&quot;）。见 <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/taric/quota_consultation.jsp\">EU TARIC 配额查询</a>。这印证了余额必须是&quot;带观测时间的快照&quot;——官方本身就以更新时点标注其新鲜度。</p>\n<p>关键在于把余额从&quot;一个数字&quot;改造成&quot;<strong>带时间戳与来源的快照 + 消耗速率估计</strong>&quot;。单看&quot;剩余 400 吨&quot;没有意义；&quot;剩余 400 吨、近 7 天日均消耗 85 吨、本期还剩 6 天&quot;才构成可决策的信号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[外部来源] --&gt; A1[主管机关配额公告/查询接口]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[证件签发与消耗台账]&#10;    A --&gt; A3[行业协会/代理通知]&#10;    A1 --&gt; B[余额快照 balance_snapshot]&#10;    A2 --&gt; B&#10;    A3 --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; C[消耗速率估计 burn_rate]&#10;    C --&gt; D{预计可维持天数}&#10;    D --&gt;|充足| E[正常下单]&#10;    D --&gt;|紧张| F[触发申请/加急]&#10;    D --&gt;|不足| G[启用配额外成本方案]&#10;    F --&gt; H[申请配额证]&#10;    H --&gt; I[PO 占用 reserved_qty]&#10;    I --&gt; J[报关消耗 consumed_qty]\">graph TD\n    A[外部来源] --&gt; A1[主管机关配额公告/查询接口]\n    A --&gt; A2[证件签发与消耗台账]\n    A --&gt; A3[行业协会/代理通知]\n    A1 --&gt; B[余额快照 balance_snapshot]\n    A2 --&gt; B\n    A3 --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C[消耗速率估计 burn_rate]\n    C --&gt; D{预计可维持天数}\n    D --&gt;|充足| E[正常下单]\n    D --&gt;|紧张| F[触发申请/加急]\n    D --&gt;|不足| G[启用配额外成本方案]\n    F --&gt; H[申请配额证]\n    H --&gt; I[PO 占用 reserved_qty]\n    I --&gt; J[报关消耗 consumed_qty]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>可信窗口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配额公告（总量/期间）</td>\n<td>主管机关</td>\n<td>每期一次</td>\n<td>整期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>官方余额查询</td>\n<td>主管机关接口</td>\n<td>按日或实时</td>\n<td>数小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自有证件台账</td>\n<td>内部系统</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消耗速率</td>\n<td>内部报关流水 + 官方余额差</td>\n<td>按日滚动</td>\n<td>数天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键/耗尽标记</td>\n<td>主管机关</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>至状态改变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"余额快照与新鲜度\">余额快照与新鲜度</h2><h3 id=\"快照表与新鲜度字段\">快照表与新鲜度字段</h3><p>余额的外部性决定了它必须是<strong>快照 + 新鲜度</strong>的结构，而不是一个字段。查询时先判新鲜度，过期快照只能用于趋势分析，不能用于单票计税。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE quota_balance_snapshot (&#10;  snapshot_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  quota_order_number TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  origin_country     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  observed_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,        -- 观测时刻（来源时间）&#10;  recorded_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  total_qty          NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  remaining_qty      NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  status             TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (status IN&#10;                       (&#39;NOT_BLOCKED&#39;,&#39;NOT_EXHAUSTED&#39;,&#39;EXHAUSTED&#39;,&#39;BLOCKED&#39;,&#39;CRITICAL&#39;)),&#10;  source             TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (source IN (&#39;AUTHORITY_API&#39;,&#39;AUTHORITY_NOTICE&#39;,&#39;CERT_LEDGER&#39;)),&#10;  confidence         NUMERIC(3,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1.00&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 取最新一次官方快照&#10;SELECT * FROM quota_balance_snapshot&#10; WHERE quota_order_number = $1 AND origin_country = $2&#10;   AND source IN (&#39;AUTHORITY_API&#39;,&#39;AUTHORITY_NOTICE&#39;)&#10; ORDER BY observed_at DESC LIMIT 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_balance_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_country     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observed_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 观测时刻（来源时间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recorded_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_qty          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remaining_qty      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                       (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NOT_BLOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NOT_EXHAUSTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXHAUSTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BLOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CRITICAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AUTHORITY_API'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AUTHORITY_NOTICE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CERT_LEDGER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 取最新一次官方快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_balance_snapshot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AUTHORITY_API'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AUTHORITY_NOTICE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>区分 <code>observed_at</code>（来源数据反映的时刻）与 <code>recorded_at</code>（我们写入的时刻）是必要的：官方接口返回的数据可能本身滞后一天，若用写入时刻做新鲜度判断，会高估可信度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"freshness(snapshot):&#10;  age = now() - snapshot.observed_at&#10;  if age &lt;= 2h  : usable for per-entry duty computation&#10;  if age &lt;= 24h : usable for planning and reservation&#10;  if age &gt;  24h : trend only; force refresh before any entry decision\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>freshness(snapshot):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  age = now() - snapshot.observed_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if age &#x3C;= 2h  : usable for per-entry duty computation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if age &#x3C;= 24h : usable for planning and reservation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if age >  24h : trend only; force refresh before any entry decision</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"消耗速率与预计耗尽日的推算\">消耗速率与预计耗尽日的推算</h3><p>有了历史快照序列，就能估计消耗速率并推算耗尽时点。这是把余额变成决策信号的核心一步。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"burn_rate(snapshots, window_days = 7):&#10;  # 用窗口内首末快照的剩余量差除以实际天数&#10;  first = oldest snapshot within window where remaining_qty is not null&#10;  last  = newest snapshot within window&#10;  days  = max(1, (last.observed_at - first.observed_at) in days)&#10;  rate  = (first.remaining_qty - last.remaining_qty) / days&#10;  if rate &lt;= 0: return { rate: 0, days_left: INF, note: &#39;no consumption observed&#39; }&#10;  return { rate: rate, days_left: last.remaining_qty / rate }&#10;&#10;decision(balance, burn):&#10;  if burn.days_left &gt; 60      -&gt; NORMAL&#10;  if burn.days_left &gt; 21      -&gt; WATCH        # 提前准备申请材料&#10;  if burn.days_left &gt; 7       -&gt; URGENT       # 并行启用配额外方案&#10;  else                        -&gt; ACT_NOW      # 按配额外成本重新定价\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>burn_rate(snapshots, window_days = 7):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 用窗口内首末快照的剩余量差除以实际天数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  first = oldest snapshot within window where remaining_qty is not null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  last  = newest snapshot within window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  days  = max(1, (last.observed_at - first.observed_at) in days)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rate  = (first.remaining_qty - last.remaining_qty) / days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if rate &#x3C;= 0: return { rate: 0, days_left: INF, note: 'no consumption observed' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return { rate: rate, days_left: last.remaining_qty / rate }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>decision(balance, burn):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if burn.days_left > 60      -> NORMAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if burn.days_left > 21      -> WATCH        # 提前准备申请材料</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if burn.days_left > 7       -> URGENT       # 并行启用配额外方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else                        -> ACT_NOW      # 按配额外成本重新定价</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>days_left</code> 使用 <code>rate &lt;= 0</code> 的显式分支而非除零，是因为配额在期内可能长时间零消耗（淡季），此时除零会给出无穷大或崩溃。零消耗期应明确标为&quot;无消耗观测&quot;，而不是推断为&quot;额度充裕&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申请-时机-材料与配额期\">申请：时机、材料与配额期</h2><h3 id=\"申请窗口与阶段\">申请窗口与阶段</h3><p>配额申请是<strong>有窗口的行政程序</strong>，错过窗口就要等下一个配额期。因此申请动作必须由余额信号驱动并前置到安全线之前。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>前置时间</th>\n<th>关键材料</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预准备</td>\n<td>days_left ≤ 60</td>\n<td>材料准备 2–4 周</td>\n<td>进口计划、历史业绩、用途说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正式申请</td>\n<td>官方开放申请期开始</td>\n<td>依公告</td>\n<td>申请表、资质证明、预计进口量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补正</td>\n<td>主管机关要求</td>\n<td>依通知（通常 5–15 工作日）</td>\n<td>补充证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取得证件</td>\n<td>审批通过</td>\n<td>依公告</td>\n<td>配额证（含有效期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未获足额</td>\n<td>分配量 &lt; 申请量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>按配额外成本调整采购计划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>申请期本身受&quot;申请窗口&quot;约束：部分配额采用&quot;同时审查&quot;（simultaneous examination）方式，即所有申请在窗口内提交、统一审查分配，而非先到先得。这种情况下<strong>提交时间不影响结果，但错过窗口完全失去资格</strong>，因此定时提醒比实时抢额度更重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下单占用-把余额接进采购流程\">下单占用：把余额接进采购流程</h2><h3 id=\"两种占用粒度与三账闭环\">两种占用粒度与三账闭环</h3><p>余额信号的最终消费者是采购流程。把余额接到 PO 上有两种粒度，各有利弊。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"模式 A: PO 级预占（推荐用于长交期采购）&#10;  on PO confirmed:&#10;    if quota.status == &#39;EXHAUSTED&#39; or available(cert) &lt; qty:&#10;        po.quota_status = &#39;UNSECURED&#39;&#10;        po.duty_basis  = &#39;OVER_QUOTA&#39;      # 成本按配额外税率预提&#10;    else:&#10;        reserve(cert, qty, po_id)&#10;        po.quota_status = &#39;SECURED&#39;&#10;        po.duty_basis  = &#39;IN_QUOTA&#39;&#10;&#10;模式 B: 报关级占用（仅适用于交期极短或现货采购）&#10;  on entry accepted:&#10;    try consume(cert, entry, qty)          # 失败则整票按配额外\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>模式 A: PO 级预占（推荐用于长交期采购）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  on PO confirmed:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if quota.status == 'EXHAUSTED' or available(cert) &#x3C; qty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        po.quota_status = 'UNSECURED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        po.duty_basis  = 'OVER_QUOTA'      # 成本按配额外税率预提</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        reserve(cert, qty, po_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        po.quota_status = 'SECURED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        po.duty_basis  = 'IN_QUOTA'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>模式 B: 报关级占用（仅适用于交期极短或现货采购）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  on entry accepted:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try consume(cert, entry, qty)          # 失败则整票按配额外</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模式 A 的价值在于把&quot;配额风险&quot;从报关时点提前到采购决策时点，使采购可以比较&quot;接受配额外成本&quot;与&quot;换源/换期&quot;两条路径。模式 B 只适用于交期以天计的现货场景，长期使用会让采购对着一个永远正确的账面余额做错误的成本假设。</p>\n<p>两条路径的差异必须显式记录，否则财务无法解释为什么同一商品的月度毛利波动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE quota_reservation (&#10;  reservation_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  certificate_id  TEXT REFERENCES quota_certificate(certificate_id),&#10;  po_id           TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  qty             NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  duty_basis      TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (duty_basis IN (&#39;IN_QUOTA&#39;,&#39;OVER_QUOTA&#39;,&#39;UNSECURED&#39;)),&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  expires_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,               -- 预计发运日 + buffer&#10;  released_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  entry_id        TEXT                       -- 报关后回填，形成闭环&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_reservation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reservation_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certificate_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_certificate(certificate_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  po_id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duty_basis      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (duty_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IN_QUOTA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OVER_QUOTA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNSECURED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 预计发运日 + buffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  released_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                       -- 报关后回填，形成闭环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>entry_id</code> 回填是闭环的关键：它让&quot;预留了多少、实际消耗了多少、释放了多少&quot;三笔账可以对上，也让配额利用率成为可测量的运营指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"余额数据质量的常见问题\">余额数据质量的常见问题</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>检测方法</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快照陈旧</td>\n<td>按旧余额报关，实际已耗尽</td>\n<td>与报关结果比对，出现意外的配额外征收</td>\n<td>强制刷新阈值 + 报关前校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>官方口径差异</td>\n<td>官方余额与自算台账长期偏离</td>\n<td>定期对账，偏差 &gt; 2% 告警</td>\n<td>以官方为准，修正自算口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位不一致</td>\n<td>kg vs 吨混用</td>\n<td>单位字段非空约束</td>\n<td>全链路统一 quota_unit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原产国未拆分</td>\n<td>跨国共享一个余额</td>\n<td>同一配额号出现多个 origin 行</td>\n<td>按 (配额号, 原产国) 建键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复计数</td>\n<td>同一报关被两个来源计入消耗</td>\n<td>用 entry_id 去重</td>\n<td>消耗记录唯一约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键状态滞后</td>\n<td>critical 已标记但系统未反应</td>\n<td>状态字段变更未触发告警</td>\n<td>状态变更事件驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;官方口径差异&quot;值得单独强调：官方余额往往以&quot;许可证签发量&quot;而非&quot;实际清关量&quot;计量，而自算台账常以实际报关量计量，两者的时间差会产生系统性偏离。因此对账的目标不是&quot;完全相等&quot;，而是&quot;偏差稳定且可解释&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>配额余额是外部共享状态，必须建模为&quot;<strong>带 observed_at 与来源的快照</strong>&quot;，并按新鲜度分级使用（2 小时计税、24 小时计划、更久仅作趋势）。</li>\n<li>单看剩余量不足以决策；需要 <code>burn_rate</code> 与 <code>days_left</code>（剩余量 ÷ 消耗速率），并把零消耗期显式标为&quot;无消耗观测&quot;而非&quot;额度充裕&quot;。</li>\n<li>申请是有窗口的行政程序：同时审查方式下提交时点不影响结果，但错过窗口完全失去资格，因此定时提醒优先于实时抢额。</li>\n<li>采购侧的占用应绑定 PO 确认事件（模式 A），把配额风险提前到采购决策时点，并以 <code>duty_basis</code> 区分配额内/外成本基础。</li>\n<li><code>entry_id</code> 回填形成&quot;预留—消耗—释放&quot;三账闭环，使配额利用率可测量。</li>\n<li>对账目标是&quot;偏差稳定且可解释&quot;，不是逐数字相等——官方以签发量计、内部以清关量计，天然存在时间差。TRQ 两档税率的计算见 <a href=\"trq-in-out-two-tier-rate\">TRQ 配额内/外两档税率</a>，证件的三量分离见 <a href=\"quota-license-certificate-manage\">配额证/许可证件管理与占用</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"配额余额查询、申请与下单占用","id":"配额余额查询-申请与下单占用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"余额快照与新鲜度","id":"余额快照与新鲜度"},{"level":3,"text":"快照表与新鲜度字段","id":"快照表与新鲜度字段"},{"level":3,"text":"消耗速率与预计耗尽日的推算","id":"消耗速率与预计耗尽日的推算"},{"level":2,"text":"申请：时机、材料与配额期","id":"申请-时机-材料与配额期"},{"level":3,"text":"申请窗口与阶段","id":"申请窗口与阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"下单占用：把余额接进采购流程","id":"下单占用-把余额接进采购流程"},{"level":3,"text":"两种占用粒度与三账闭环","id":"两种占用粒度与三账闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"余额数据质量的常见问题","id":"余额数据质量的常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"配额证与许可证件的管理与占用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/quota-license-certificate-manage"},"next":{"title":"非优惠原产地溯源与举证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-compliance-procurement/non-preferential-origin-evidence"}}